75
00:05:45,160 --> 00:05:46,200
Home...

76
00:05:47,560 --> 00:05:49,160
A long time ago,

77
00:05:49,520 --> 00:05:52,360
there was a sacred cultivation ground beneath the starry sky

78
00:05:52,680 --> 00:05:54,440
called the Celestial Domain.

79
00:05:54,720 --> 00:05:57,050
Legend says it abandoned the cultivators

80
00:05:57,080 --> 00:05:59,200
leaving behind only 4 gates of ascension.

81
00:05:59,800 --> 00:06:00,560
Wind,

82
00:06:00,360 --> 00:06:01,080
Rain,

83
00:06:01,120 --> 00:06:01,880
Thunder,

84
00:06:01,800 --> 00:06:02,560
and Lightning.

85
00:06:03,280 --> 00:06:06,280
The 4 gates later transformed into the Celestial Realms.

86
00:06:06,760 --> 00:06:09,200
The 4 Celestial Realms govern the 4 Star Systems.

87
00:06:09,960 --> 00:06:11,680
Above our Allheaven Star System

88
00:06:12,520 --> 00:06:14,200
