91
00:06:20,480 --> 00:06:22,000
When it appeared,

92
00:06:22,560 --> 00:06:26,400
all the top cultivators sensed the aura of the Ancient Celestial Domain

93
00:06:26,800 --> 00:06:28,600
and went crazy for it.

94
00:06:28,960 --> 00:06:31,000
But in the end, it vanished mysteriously.

95
00:06:33,360 --> 00:06:34,840
Countless years later,

96
00:06:35,800 --> 00:06:37,240
