97
00:06:37,840 --> 00:06:40,720
it appeared in the Rain Celestial Realm of the Alliance Star System.

98
00:06:43,160 --> 00:06:45,010
Was that ancient teleportation formation

99
00:06:44,960 --> 00:06:46,200
