100
00:06:46,640 --> 00:06:48,360
It's not mine,

101
00:06:48,880 --> 00:06:51,600
but it was indeed made by an Allheaven cultivator.

102
00:06:52,120 --> 00:06:54,250
That teleportation formation is defective,

103
00:06:54,080 --> 00:06:56,210
