104
00:06:56,200 --> 00:06:58,890
That was the story of the Heaven Defying Bead.

105
00:06:58,760 --> 00:07:01,200
As for that broken soul, my ancestors can revive it.

106
00:07:01,640 --> 00:07:04,040
