110
00:07:12,640 --> 00:07:15,040
Which sect in the Allheaven Star System do you belong to ?

111
00:07:14,840 --> 00:07:17,200
The Allheaven Star System has no sects,

112
00:07:17,720 --> 00:07:19,440
