122
00:07:35,360 --> 00:07:37,450
This woman must be hiding something !

123
00:07:37,880 --> 00:07:39,320
Don't you want to revive her !?

124
00:07:40,240 --> 00:07:40,880
Wang Lin !

125
00:07:40,640 --> 00:07:42,250
She is luring me to Allheaven

126
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:43,330
