136
00:07:55,920 --> 00:07:56,560
Shut up !

137
00:07:56,960 --> 00:07:58,000
Wang Lin...

138
00:07:58,400 --> 00:07:59,440
Wang Lin !

139
00:07:59,680 --> 00:08:00,640
What are you doing !?

140
00:08:00,400 --> 00:08:02,490
This woman was sealed inside the scroll

141
00:08:02,240 --> 00:08:04,010
