142
00:08:04,240 --> 00:08:07,680
However, she absorbed a Tattoo Beast Atlas and started recovering.

143
00:08:07,440 --> 00:08:08,450
Wang Lin !

144
00:08:08,420 --> 00:08:09,110
Seal !

145
00:08:08,880 --> 00:08:11,170
I curse your Dao to be completely eradicated

146
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:12,600
