174
00:10:47,680 --> 00:10:54,130
Note: In the world of the Mosquito Beasts, if they were abandoned by their king, then they could only die, unless a new king appears that is.

175
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:55,200
Foolish children...

176
00:10:56,080 --> 00:10:57,720
Given the purity of its bloodline,

177
00:10:58,360 --> 00:11:00,560
