228
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:52,400
Cultivate it diligently.

229
00:13:54,560 --> 00:13:55,810
Thank you, Master...

230
00:13:55,960 --> 00:13:57,000
Thirteen

231
00:13:57,280 --> 00:13:58,770
