280
00:16:50,760 --> 00:16:52,280
Xixue's aura !

281
00:16:57,160 --> 00:16:58,520
So it was you !

282
00:17:00,240 --> 00:17:01,280
Wang Lin,

283
00:17:01,400 --> 00:17:03,000
